#. module: barcodes_gs1_label_purchase
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/barcodes_gs1_label_purchase/report/report_barcode_gs1.py:0
msgid ""
"A line of the receipt holds %(quantity)s %(uom)s of the product %(product)s,"
" less than one of its units received. Correct it."
msgstr ""
"Una línea del albarán tiene %(quantity)s %(uom)s del producto %(product)s, "
"menos de una de sus unidades recibidas. Corríjala."

#. module: barcodes_gs1_label_purchase
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/barcodes_gs1_label_purchase/report/report_barcode_gs1.py:0
msgid ""
"A line of the receipt holds %(quantity)s %(uom)s of the product %(product)s,"
" which is not a multiple of %(share)s %(uom)s, the quantity of each unit "
"received. Correct it."
msgstr ""
"Una línea del albarán tiene %(quantity)s %(uom)s del producto %(product)s, "
"que no es un múltiplo de %(share)s %(uom)s, la cantidad de cada unidad "
"recibida. Corríjala."

#. module: barcodes_gs1_label_purchase
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:barcodes_gs1_label_purchase.field_uom_uom__dynamic_ratio
msgid "Dynamic Ratio"
msgstr "Relación dinámica"

#. module: barcodes_gs1_label_purchase
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:barcodes_gs1_label_purchase.field_stock_move__purchase_uom_qty
msgid ""
"How many units of the purchase line this receipt line brings, when they are "
"bought in a unit whose quantity is known only on receipt: the labels share "
"the quantity received among them. It proposes the units still to come."
msgstr ""
"Cuántas unidades de la línea de compra trae esta línea del albarán, cuando "
"se compran en una unidad cuya cantidad solo se conoce al recibirlas: las "
"etiquetas reparten entre ellas la cantidad recibida. Propone las unidades "
"que aún faltan por llegar."

#. module: barcodes_gs1_label_purchase
#: model:ir.model,name:barcodes_gs1_label_purchase.model_uom_uom
msgid "Product Unit of Measure"
msgstr "Unidad de medida del producto"

#. module: barcodes_gs1_label_purchase
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:barcodes_gs1_label_purchase.field_stock_move__purchase_uom_qty_entered
msgid "Purchase Units Entered"
msgstr "Unidades de compra introducidas"

#. module: barcodes_gs1_label_purchase
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:barcodes_gs1_label_purchase.field_stock_move__purchase_uom_qty
msgid "Purchase Units Received"
msgstr "Unidades de compra recibidas"

#. module: barcodes_gs1_label_purchase
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:barcodes_gs1_label_purchase.field_stock_move__is_dynamic_receipt
msgid "Receipt in a Dynamic Unit"
msgstr "Recepción en una unidad dinámica"

#. module: barcodes_gs1_label_purchase
#: model:ir.model,name:barcodes_gs1_label_purchase.model_report_barcodes_gs1_label_report_gs1_barcode
msgid "Report GS1 Barcode"
msgstr "Informe de código de barras GS1"

#. module: barcodes_gs1_label_purchase
#: model:ir.model,name:barcodes_gs1_label_purchase.model_stock_move
msgid "Stock Move"
msgstr "Movimiento de stock"

#. module: barcodes_gs1_label_purchase
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/barcodes_gs1_label_purchase/report/report_barcode_gs1.py:0
msgid ""
"The lines of the receipt hold %(units_held)s units of %(share)s %(uom)s of "
"the product %(product)s, but %(units_received)s purchase units were "
"received. Correct them."
msgstr ""
"Las líneas del albarán tienen %(units_held)s unidades de %(share)s %(uom)s "
"del producto %(product)s, pero se han recibido %(units_received)s unidades "
"de compra. Corríjalas."

#. module: barcodes_gs1_label_purchase
#: model:ir.model.constraint,message:barcodes_gs1_label_purchase.constraint_stock_move_purchase_uom_qty_not_negative
msgid "The purchase units received cannot be negative."
msgstr "Las unidades de compra recibidas no pueden ser negativas."

#. module: barcodes_gs1_label_purchase
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:barcodes_gs1_label_purchase.field_stock_move__purchase_uom_qty_entered
msgid ""
"The purchase units received of this receipt line were entered, so it no "
"longer proposes them."
msgstr ""
"Las unidades de compra recibidas de esta línea del albarán se han "
"introducido, por lo que ya no las propone."

#. module: barcodes_gs1_label_purchase
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:barcodes_gs1_label_purchase.field_uom_uom__dynamic_ratio
msgid ""
"The quantity of this unit is known only when the goods are received, such as"
" a crate of produce weighed on arrival: its ratio is only an estimate. A "
"receipt line bought in this unit records its purchase units received, and "
"its labels share the quantity received among them."
msgstr ""
"La cantidad de esta unidad solo se conoce al recibir la mercancía, como una "
"caja de fruta que se pesa al llegar: su ratio solo es una estimación. Una "
"línea de albarán comprada en esta unidad registra sus unidades de compra "
"recibidas, y sus etiquetas reparten entre ellas la cantidad recibida."

#. module: barcodes_gs1_label_purchase
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/barcodes_gs1_label_purchase/report/report_barcode_gs1.py:0
msgid ""
"The receipt has no purchase units received of the product %(product)s to "
"share the quantity received among. Unlock it (Lock/Unlock) and enter them on"
" the product's line."
msgstr ""
"El albarán no tiene unidades de compra recibidas del producto %(product)s "
"entre las que repartir la cantidad recibida. Desbloquéelo "
"(Bloquear/Desbloquear) e introdúzcalas en la línea del producto."
